{"strongs": "H2506", "word": "חֵ֫לֶק", "translit": "che.leq", "root": "חלץ", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "portion, tract, territory", "definition": "I. חֵ֫לֶק noun masculine Josh 18:5 portion, tract, territory — ׳ ח absolute Gen 31:14 +; construct Gen 14:24 +; suffix חֶלְקִי Ps 16:5 + 6 t.; חֶלְקְךָ Num 18:20 ; Eccl 9:9 חֶלְקֶ֑ךָ Ps 50:18 חֶלְקֵךְ Isa 57:6 חֶלְקוֺ Hab 1:16 + 5 t.; חֶלְקָם Gen 14:24 + 3 t.; plural חֲלָקִים Josh 18:5 + 5 t.; suffix חֶלְקֵיהֶם Hos 5:7 — 1. portion, share: \\ \\ a. of booty Gen 14:24 (twice in verse); Num 31:36 ( P ) 1Sam 30:24 (twice in verse). \\ \\ b. of food Lev 6:10 ( P ); יאכלו ׳ כּח ׳ ח Deut 18:8 = food Hab 1:16 (|| מַאֲכָל ); so (of unrestricted charity) Eccl 11:2 see Now . \\ \\ c. followed by בְּ , share or interest in Eccl 9:6 , with idea of obligation to Gen 31:14 ( E ; in father's house), 2Sam 20:1 = 1Kgs 12:16 = 2Chr 10:16 (in royal line; all || נַחֲלָה ); of right ( privilege ) in ביהוה ׳ ח Josh 22:25 ; Josh 22:27 ( P ); Neh 2:20 (in Jerusalem; + צְדָקָה וְזִכָּרוֺן ), \\ \\ d. proper share or part אַעֲנֶה חֶלְקִי Job 32:17 i.e. I will do my part in replying. Especially 2. portion, tract , of land: \\ \\ a. as distributive at conquest Josh 19:9 , seven portions Josh 18:5 ; Josh 18:6 ; Josh 18:9 (all J E ) v Josh 18:7 ( J E ; + נחלה in || clause), Josh 15:13 ; Josh 19:9 (both P ); none for tribe of Levi Deut 10:9 ; Deut 12:12 ; Deut 14:27 ; Deut 14:29 ; Deut 18:1 ; Josh 18:7 (all D ; || נחלה ), Josh 14:4 ( P ), none for priests Num 18:20 ( P ; || verb נחל ). \\ \\ b. of land possessed by people Hos 5:7 ; Mic 2:4 . \\ \\ c. portion to be assigned after exile Isa 61:7 ; Ezek 45:7 ; Ezek 48:8 ; Ezek 48:21 , חֶלְקוֺ עַלאַֿדְמַת הַקֹּדֶשׁ Zech 2:16 . \\ \\ d. specifically of town-land , district about a town, יִזְרְעֵאל ׳ ח 2Kgs 9:10 ; 2Kgs 9:36 + 1Kgs 21:23 ( ᵑ0 חֵל ), ׳ יִזְ ׳ הַשָּׂדֶה בְּח v 1Kgs 21:37 . \\ \\ e. הַחֵלֶק Amos 7:4 (opposed to תְּהוֺם ) apparently of land of Israel 3. hence portion , i.e. (acquired) possession: \\ \\ a. of people as ׳ י 's possession Deut 32:9 (|| חֶבֶל נחלתו ); but especially \\ \\ b. of ׳ י as possession of his servants: of priests, as enjoying perquisites of altar Num 18:20 ( P ; || נחלה ), in spiritual sense Ps 73:26 ; Ps 119:57 ; Lam 3:24 מְנָת חֶלְקִי ׳ י Ps 16:5 בְּאֶרֶץ הַחַיִּים ׳ ח Ps 142:6 hence יעקב ׳ ח of ׳ י Jer 10:16 = Jer 51:19 ( שֵׁבֶט נַחֲלָתוֺ in || clause) 4. chosen portion , habitual mode of life ׳ עִםמְֿנָאֲפִים ח Ps 50:18 with adulterers is thy chosen life (companionship, shewing character); בְּחַלְּקֵינַֿחַל חֶלְקֵךְ Isa 57:6 among smooth (things i.e. stones) of a brook-bed is thy chosen life (of idolatrous habit; see חָלָק ); חֶלְקָם בַּחַיִּים Ps 17:14 . 5. portion, award , from God אֱלוֺהַּ ׳ ח Job 31:2 (|| נחלה ); specifically of punishment of wicked Isa 17:14 (|| גּוֺרָל ), עִםאֵֿל Job 27:13 , מֵאֱלֹהִים Job 20:29 (|| נחלה ); = profit, reward חֶלְקִי מִכָּלעֲֿמָלִי Eccl 2:10 , compare v Eccl 2:21 ; Eccl 3:22 ; Eccl 5:17 ; Eccl 5:18 ; Eccl 9:9 . — לְחֵלָק Job 17:5 is dubious: a share of feast, or of booty, Kmp Hi ; a prey, spoil , Ew Di Da ; AV flattery does not suit context.", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2811')\">BDB2811</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2506')\">H2506</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2810')\">BDB2810</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2812')\">BDB2812</entry></div><p> I. <bdbheb>חֵ֫לֶק</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Josh 18:5\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(6,18,5)\">Josh 18:5</ref></sup> <highlightword>portion, tract, territory</highlightword> — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> absolute <ref ref=\"Gen 31:14\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(1,31,14)\">Gen 31:14</ref> +; construct <ref ref=\"Gen 14:24\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(1,14,24)\">Gen 14:24</ref> +; suffix <bdbheb>חֶלְקִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 16:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,16,5)\">Ps 16:5</ref> + 6 t.; <bdbheb>חֶלְקְךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 18:20\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(4,18,20)\">Num 18:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Eccl 9:9\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(21,9,9)\">Eccl 9:9</ref> <bdbheb>חֶלְקֶ֑ךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 50:18\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(19,50,18)\">Ps 50:18</ref> <bdbheb>חֶלְקֵךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 57:6\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"57\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"57\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(23,57,6)\">Isa 57:6</ref> <bdbheb>חֶלְקוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hab 1:16\" b=\"35\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(35,1,16)\">Hab 1:16</ref> + 5 t.; <bdbheb>חֶלְקָם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 14:24\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(1,14,24)\">Gen 14:24</ref> + 3 t.; plural <bdbheb>חֲלָקִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 18:5\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(6,18,5)\">Josh 18:5</ref> + 5 t.; suffix <bdbheb>חֶלְקֵיהֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 5:7\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(28,5,7)\">Hos 5:7</ref> — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>portion, share:</highlight> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> of booty <ref ref=\"Gen 14:24\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(1,14,24)\">Gen 14:24</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Num 31:36\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(4,31,36)\">Num 31:36</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>) <ref ref=\"1Sam 30:24\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(9,30,24)\">1Sam 30:24</ref> (twice in verse). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> of food <ref ref=\"Lev 6:10\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(3,6,10)\">Lev 6:10</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); <bdbheb>יאכלו</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כּח</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 18:8\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(5,18,8)\">Deut 18:8</ref> = food <ref ref=\"Hab 1:16\" b=\"35\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(35,1,16)\">Hab 1:16</ref> (|| <bdbheb>מַאֲכָל</bdbheb>); so (of unrestricted charity) <ref ref=\"Eccl 11:2\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(21,11,2)\">Eccl 11:2</ref> see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Now')\">Now</lookup>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> followed by <bdbheb>בְּ</bdbheb>, <highlight>share</highlight> or <highlight>interest in</highlight> <ref ref=\"Eccl 9:6\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(21,9,6)\">Eccl 9:6</ref>, with idea of <highlight>obligation to</highlight> <ref ref=\"Gen 31:14\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(1,31,14)\">Gen 31:14</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>; in father's house), <ref ref=\"2Sam 20:1\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(10,20,1)\">2Sam 20:1</ref> = <ref ref=\"1Kgs 12:16\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(11,12,16)\">1Kgs 12:16</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 10:16\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(14,10,16)\">2Chr 10:16</ref> (in royal line; all || <bdbheb>נַחֲלָה</bdbheb>); of <highlight>right</highlight> (<highlight>privilege</highlight>) <highlight>in</highlight> <bdbheb>ביהוה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 22:25\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(6,22,25)\">Josh 22:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 22:27\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(6,22,27)\">Josh 22:27</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); <ref ref=\"Neh 2:20\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(16,2,20)\">Neh 2:20</ref> (in Jerusalem; + <bdbheb>צְדָקָה וְזִכָּרוֺן</bdbheb>), <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> proper <highlight>share</highlight> or <highlight>part</highlight> <bdbheb>אַעֲנֶה חֶלְקִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 32:17\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(18,32,17)\">Job 32:17</ref> i.e. I will do my part in replying. Especially </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>portion, tract</highlight>, of land: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> as distributive at conquest <ref ref=\"Josh 19:9\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(6,19,9)\">Josh 19:9</ref>, seven <highlight>portions</highlight> <ref ref=\"Josh 18:5\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(6,18,5)\">Josh 18:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 18:6\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(6,18,6)\">Josh 18:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 18:9\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(6,18,9)\">Josh 18:9</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>) v<ref ref=\"Josh 18:7\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(6,18,7)\">Josh 18:7</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>; + <bdbheb>נחלה</bdbheb> in || clause), <ref ref=\"Josh 15:13\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(6,15,13)\">Josh 15:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 19:9\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(6,19,9)\">Josh 19:9</ref> (both <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); none for tribe of Levi <ref ref=\"Deut 10:9\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(5,10,9)\">Deut 10:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 12:12\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(5,12,12)\">Deut 12:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 14:27\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(5,14,27)\">Deut 14:27</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 14:29\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(5,14,29)\">Deut 14:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 18:1\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(5,18,1)\">Deut 18:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 18:7\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(6,18,7)\">Josh 18:7</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('D')\"><reflink>D</reflink></lookup>; || <bdbheb>נחלה</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Josh 14:4\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(6,14,4)\">Josh 14:4</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), none for priests <ref ref=\"Num 18:20\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(4,18,20)\">Num 18:20</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>; || verb <bdbheb>נחל</bdbheb>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> of land possessed by people <ref ref=\"Hos 5:7\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(28,5,7)\">Hos 5:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Mic 2:4\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(33,2,4)\">Mic 2:4</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> portion to be assigned after exile <ref ref=\"Isa 61:7\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"61\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"61\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(23,61,7)\">Isa 61:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 45:7\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(26,45,7)\">Ezek 45:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 48:8\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(26,48,8)\">Ezek 48:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 48:21\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(26,48,21)\">Ezek 48:21</ref>, <bdbheb>חֶלְקוֺ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>עַלאַֿדְמַת הַקֹּדֶשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Zech 2:16\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(38,2,16)\">Zech 2:16</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> specifically of <highlight>town-land</highlight>, district about a town, <bdbheb>יִזְרְעֵאל</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 9:10\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(12,9,10)\">2Kgs 9:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 9:36\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(12,9,36)\">2Kgs 9:36</ref> + <ref ref=\"1Kgs 21:23\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(11,21,23)\">1Kgs 21:23</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('MT')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ0</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <bdbheb>חֵל</bdbheb>), <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>יִזְ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הַשָּׂדֶה בְּח</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"1Kgs 21:37\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(11,21,37)\">1Kgs 21:37</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>e.</b> <bdbheb>הַחֵלֶק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 7:4\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(30,7,4)\">Amos 7:4</ref> (opposed to <bdbheb>תְּהוֺם</bdbheb>) apparently of <highlight>land</highlight> of Israel </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> hence <highlight>portion</highlight>, i.e. (acquired) <highlight>possession:</highlight> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> of people as <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>'s possession <ref ref=\"Deut 32:9\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(5,32,9)\">Deut 32:9</ref> (|| <bdbheb>חֶבֶל נחלתו</bdbheb>); but especially <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> as possession of his servants: of priests, as enjoying perquisites of altar <ref ref=\"Num 18:20\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(4,18,20)\">Num 18:20</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>; || <bdbheb>נחלה</bdbheb>), in spiritual sense <ref ref=\"Ps 73:26\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"73\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"73\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(19,73,26)\">Ps 73:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 119:57\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"57\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"57\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,57)\">Ps 119:57</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lam 3:24\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(25,3,24)\">Lam 3:24</ref> <bdbheb>מְנָת חֶלְקִי</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 16:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,16,5)\">Ps 16:5</ref> <bdbheb>בְּאֶרֶץ הַחַיִּים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 142:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"142\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"142\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,142,6)\">Ps 142:6</ref> hence <bdbheb>יעקב</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 10:16\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(24,10,16)\">Jer 10:16</ref> = <ref ref=\"Jer 51:19\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(24,51,19)\">Jer 51:19</ref> (<bdbheb>שֵׁבֶט נַחֲלָתוֺ</bdbheb> in || clause) </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> chosen <highlight>portion</highlight>, habitual mode of life <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עִםמְֿנָאֲפִים ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 50:18\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(19,50,18)\">Ps 50:18</ref> <highlight>with adulterers is thy chosen life</highlight> (companionship, shewing character); <bdbheb>בְּחַלְּקֵינַֿחַל חֶלְקֵךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 57:6\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"57\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"57\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(23,57,6)\">Isa 57:6</ref> <highlight>among smooth</highlight> (things i.e. stones) <highlight>of a brook-bed is thy chosen life</highlight> (of idolatrous habit; see  <bdbheb><reflink>חָלָק</reflink></bdbheb>); <bdbheb>חֶלְקָם בַּחַיִּים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 17:14\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(19,17,14)\">Ps 17:14</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>5.</b> <highlight>portion, award</highlight>, from God <bdbheb>אֱלוֺהַּ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 31:2\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(18,31,2)\">Job 31:2</ref> (|| <bdbheb>נחלה</bdbheb>); specifically of punishment of wicked <ref ref=\"Isa 17:14\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(23,17,14)\">Isa 17:14</ref> (|| <bdbheb>גּוֺרָל</bdbheb>), <bdbheb>עִםאֵֿל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 27:13\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(18,27,13)\">Job 27:13</ref>, <bdbheb>מֵאֱלֹהִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 20:29\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(18,20,29)\">Job 20:29</ref> (|| <bdbheb>נחלה</bdbheb>); = <highlight>profit, reward</highlight> <bdbheb>חֶלְקִי מִכָּלעֲֿמָלִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Eccl 2:10\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(21,2,10)\">Eccl 2:10</ref>, compare v<ref ref=\"Eccl 2:21\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(21,2,21)\">Eccl 2:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Eccl 3:22\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(21,3,22)\">Eccl 3:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Eccl 5:17\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(21,5,17)\">Eccl 5:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Eccl 5:18\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(21,5,18)\">Eccl 5:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Eccl 9:9\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(21,9,9)\">Eccl 9:9</ref>. — <bdbheb>לְחֵלָק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\